      "html_url": "https://github.com/tensorviz-org/tensorviz/releases/tag/v0.1.45",
      "body": "- Add native compiled runtime packaging for Intel Mac, Linux ARM64 and Windows x64/ARM64, with architecture-specific verified installers.\n- Separate core service startup from optional PyTorch model capture dependencies and improve unsupported capture-environment diagnostics.\n- Preserve Linux x64 glibc 2.31 support, version alignment and tested upgrade/rollback gates.\n\nPublished on the [VS Code Marketplace](https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=tensorviz.tensorviz-vscode). This download is the exact Marketplace package.\n\nSource: eae4dd5d012c090d31ca1149891287ea01febc6c\n\nSHA-256: `edb17c4d891f9a6ec531c86d8f0771778bedc6f50cfe7ecf19db5789aace1990`\n",
